  "暖色 maj7/m9、細碎小調 ii–V、短句留白與鬆動的後拍。": "Warm maj7 / m9, short minor ii–V figures, space and a relaxed backbeat.",
  "慢速 add9/6/9、共同音延留與稀疏旋律；給聲部空間自然呼吸。": "Slow add9 / 6/9, common-tone suspensions and sparse melody, giving voices room to breathe.",
  "半音接近、m11/maj9、backdoor 與平滑內聲部；不急著回到 I。": "Chromatic approaches, m11 / maj9, backdoor motion and smooth inner voices, without rushing back to I.",
  "I–V–vi–IV / vi–IV–I–V，加入 sus、轉位與偶爾 iv 借用。": "I–V–vi–IV / vi–IV–I–V with sus, inversions and occasional borrowed iv.",
  "級進低音、IV–iv、平行大小調與副歌前的次屬和弦。": "Stepwise bass, IV–iv, parallel major / minor and secondary dominants before the chorus.",
