  "12 小節大調藍調：I7–IV7–V7、quick change 與 ii–V turnaround。選 12 bars 可聽完整曲式。": "12-bar major blues: I7–IV7–V7, quick change and ii–V turnarounds. Choose 12 bars for the full form.",
